  "difficulty_reason": "After the named scattering/cluster-monomial correspondences are supplied, the source-local argument isolates a limiting wall by a path-ordered product and stabilizes its coefficient as a ratio of F-polynomials. It then proves coupled diagonal and super-diagonal coefficient bounds using parity-dependent polynomial division and controls all higher-degree terms in the formal limit. This exact affine limiting-wall calculation is substantially beyond standard rank-two mutation or generating-function exercises.",
